| `[[ component.name ]].networkPolicy.allowFromSameNamespace` | `[[ component.networkpolicy.allow_from_same_namespace | to_yaml ]]` | Trafic entrant venant du namespace du composant. |
| `[[ component.name ]].networkPolicy.allowFromNamespaces` | `[[ component.networkpolicy.allow_from_namespaces | to_yaml ]]` | Namespaces autorisés en entrée, par nom. |
